  "_comment": "Approval-hold bypass keys: a call held by a hold rule is let through later only by an approval for the identical call, compared as sha256(canonical JSON of its arguments). The MCP proxy (approvalHold.ts), @intutic/gate (hold.ts) and intutic_clawde.gate (hold.py) each serialise these toolInputs to `canonical` and hash it to `targetHash`. Regenerate the expectations from the MCP proxy, never from one SDK.",
